    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-05"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Repetition is not proof of irrelevance. A product specification, safety warning, author biography, or legal condition may appear on many pages and still matter to the task. Cross-page methods should produce candidate boilerplate that is evaluated against the intended content schema, not an automatic deletion list.",
    "url": "https://www.scrapeless.com/en/wiki/what-is-boilerplate-removal",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-05"
   },
   {
